/-!
# A256184

First of two variations by Per Nørgård of his "infinity sequence", cf. A004718: u(0) = 0; u(3*n) = -u(n); u(3*n+1) = u(n) - 2; u(3*n+2) = u(n) - 1.

The 72 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A256184

